<section class="hub-group" id="hub-people" aria-label="People"><h2 class="hub-group-t">People</h2><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/life/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/alexander-the-great.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">128 lives</span><span class="hub-card-t">Great Lives</span><span class="hub-card-d">Rulers, thinkers, prophets and rebels told in full: their early years, what they did, who opposed them and what they left.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/people/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/las-meninas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">13,716 people</span><span class="hub-card-t">People</span><span class="hub-card-d">Rulers, thinkers, artists and explorers, century by century and region by region, with a chart of who lived when.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/encyclopedia/dynasties"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/louis-xiv.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Dynasties</span><span class="hub-card-t">Ruling Houses</span><span class="hub-card-d">The ruling houses of the encyclopedia, region by region, with their members and family trees.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/culture/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mohenjo-daro.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">81 cultures</span><span class="hub-card-t">Cultures and Peoples</span><span class="hub-card-d">Life before and beside the states: the first farmers and city-builders, the steppe and the sea peoples, and peoples living today.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/societies/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/feudalism.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">50 societies</span><span class="hub-card-t">Social Ladders</span><span class="hub-card-d">From emperor to enslaved: how societies ranked their people, how many stood on each rung and how they rose or fell. Be born into one by chance.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/encyclopedia/quotations"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/socrates.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">In their words</span><span class="hub-card-t">Quotations</span><span class="hub-card-d">What people of the past said and wrote, each quotation with its work, its translator and how the words reach us.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/speeches/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/pericles.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">129 speeches</span><span class="hub-card-t">Great Speeches</span><span class="hub-card-d">The words that moved history: the setting, the key passage, what followed, and the complete text where it is free to read.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="hub-group" id="hub-places" aria-label="Places"><h2 class="hub-group-t">Places</h2><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/atlas"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/catalan-atlas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">From 3500 BCE to today</span><span class="hub-card-t">Atlas</span><span class="hub-card-d">The world in any year: slide through five thousand years and watch states appear and vanish.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/city/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/constantinople.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">110 cities</span><span class="hub-card-t">Cities</span><span class="hub-card-d">Great cities through time: who founded them, who ruled them, how people lived there, and the sieges and disasters they came through.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/countries/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/great-wall-of-china.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">195 countries</span><span class="hub-card-t">Country Histories</span><span class="hub-card-d">The history of each present-day country, told through the states that lay on its soil.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/state/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/peace-of-westphalia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">5,546 states</span><span class="hub-card-t">States</span><span class="hub-card-d">Every recorded kingdom, principality, republic and chiefdom, with its lineage and connections.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/journeys"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ibn-battuta.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Stop by stop</span><span class="hub-card-t">Journeys on the Globe</span><span class="hub-card-d">Great journeys on a turning globe, one stop at a time: Alexander, Xuanzang, Ibn Battuta, Zheng He, Magellan and more.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/connections"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/congress-of-berlin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">11,383 links</span><span class="hub-card-t">Connections</span><span class="hub-card-d">Who succeeded, conquered, ruled or merged with whom: the states as one network.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/explorer"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/pax-romana.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Rise and fall charts</span><span class="hub-card-t">Power Curves</span><span class="hub-card-d">Compare the rise and fall of 556 states and empires on one timeline.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="hub-group" id="hub-events" aria-label="Events"><h2 class="hub-group-t">Events</h2><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/today-in-history/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mesoamerican-long-count-calendar.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">3,794 events</span><span class="hub-card-t">Today in History</span><span class="hub-card-d">What happened on each day of the year, across five thousand years.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/battle/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-hastings.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">103 battles</span><span class="hub-card-t">Battles</span><span class="hub-card-d">The two sides, the ground and the fighting, with a plan of the field to play phase by phase.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/encyclopedia/wars"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thirty-years-war.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Every war</span><span class="hub-card-t">Wars</span><span class="hub-card-d">The wars of the encyclopedia by region, oldest first, each with its battles, sieges and treaties.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/timeline"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/standard-of-ur.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Every state</span><span class="hub-card-t">World Timeline</span><span class="hub-card-d">Five thousand years of states and empires on one line, region by region: see who lived alongside whom.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/centuries/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/bayeux-tapestry.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">51 centuries</span><span class="hub-card-t">Centuries</span><span class="hub-card-d">World history one century at a time: the great powers, key events, people and a map.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/years/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/primary-chronicle.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">1,399 years</span><span class="hub-card-t">Year by Year</span><span class="hub-card-d">What happened in a single year: its events, the people born and the people who died, the states founded and ended.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/now"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rosetta-stone.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">In the news</span><span class="hub-card-t">History Now</span><span class="hub-card-d">History in the news with its background on the site, the anniversaries coming up, and what is new here.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="hub-group" id="hub-ideas" aria-label="Ideas"><h2 class="hub-group-t">Ideas</h2><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/religions"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/dome-of-the-rock.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">51 religions</span><span class="hub-card-t">Faiths Side by Side</span><span class="hub-card-d">Every religion in one table: when it began, its teachers and scriptures, its followers today, and its lives, works and map.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/faiths"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/borobudur.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">51 religions</span><span class="hub-card-t">Faith Maps</span><span class="hub-card-d">Where each religion began, how it spread and where it last lived on, century by century on a turning globe.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/governance"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/roman-senate.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">20 forms</span><span class="hub-card-t">Forms of Government</span><span class="hub-card-d">Who should rule? From chiefdoms and city-states to monarchies, republics, democracies and dictatorships: how each form works, and the case for and against it.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/ideology/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/karl-marx.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">43 ideologies</span><span class="hub-card-t">Ideologies</span><span class="hub-card-d">From liberalism to Legalism: where each set of ideas came from, what it holds, its record in power and what its critics say.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/movement/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/frederick-douglass.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">61 movements</span><span class="hub-card-t">Movements</span><span class="hub-card-d">Causes that changed their world: their background and aims, the people who led them, what they won and what they left.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/work/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/parthenon.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">111 works</span><span class="hub-card-t">Great Works</span><span class="hub-card-d">Texts and monuments in full: how each was made, what it holds, how it was received and how it survived.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/inventions"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/printing-press.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">291 inventions</span><span class="hub-card-t">Inventions Tree</span><span class="hub-card-d">From stone tools to the World Wide Web: when and where each invention and discovery first appeared, what it built on and what it led to.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/songs/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/cantigas-de-santa-maria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">419 songs</span><span class="hub-card-t">Songs in History</span><span class="hub-card-d">Hymns, anthems, laments and folk songs handed down through history: who made them, what they say, their words in the original and in English, and a performance.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="hub-group" id="hub-play" aria-label="Play"><h2 class="hub-group-t">Play</h2><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/games"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/pythian-games.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Eighteen games</span><span class="hub-card-t">Games</span><span class="hub-card-d">Picture puzzles, word hunts, timelines, the ranks of past societies, a globe, a daily Connections and a daily Crossword: games with real pictures and real dates, for every age.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/quiz"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rosetta-stone.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">New every day</span><span class="hub-card-t">History Quiz</span><span class="hub-card-d">Guess the empire, person, event or place from four clues, or practise as long as you like.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/today"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/astrolabe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Every day</span><span class="hub-card-t">Today at the Institute</span><span class="hub-card-d">The day in one place: its anniversary, the people born on it, the song of the day and the daily games.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/flashcards"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/house-of-wisdom.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">11,691 cards</span><span class="hub-card-t">Flashcards</span><span class="hub-card-d">Terms, faces, capitals and dates in decks of cards: the ones you miss come back sooner, the ones you know wait longer.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/write"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/rosetta-stone.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">12 languages</span><span class="hub-card-t">Write in Ancient Scripts</span><span class="hub-card-d">Cuneiform, hieroglyphs, Linear B, runes, Brahmi and more: a keyboard that shows every sign with its sound, and your writing as a picture.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/race"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/charioteer-of-delphi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">556 to race</span><span class="hub-card-t">Rise and Fall Race</span><span class="hub-card-d">Up to four states and empires race year by year: who led, when they overtook each other and how long each held on.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/kids"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/great-pyramid-of-giza.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">For young explorers</span><span class="hub-card-t">Kids corner</span><span class="hub-card-d">Pyramids, knights, Vikings and explorers: picture stories, a fact of the day and games for younger readers.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/passport"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/xuanzang.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Your stamps</span><span class="hub-card-t">My Passport</span><span class="hub-card-d">The pages you read, the centuries you visit and the games you play, with stamps to collect. Kept in your own browser.</span></span></a></li></ul></section><section class="hub-group" id="hub-read" aria-label="Read"><h2 class="hub-group-t">Read</h2><ul class="hub-grid"><li><a class="hub-card" href="/discover"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/machu-picchu.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">Look around</span><span class="hub-card-t">Discover</span><span class="hub-card-d">Pictures first: a wall of people, places, works and events to look through before you read.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/encyclopedia/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/library-of-alexandria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">34,504 entries</span><span class="hub-card-t">Encyclopedia</span><span class="hub-card-d">People, places, events, institutions and ideas, with 24,062 historical pictures.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/profiles"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/colosseum.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">1296 profiles</span><span class="hub-card-t">Profiles</span><span class="hub-card-d">In-depth histories of states and empires, religions, languages, cultures and movements: their origins, great ages and legacies, with key facts and timelines.</span></span></a></li><li><a class="hub-card" href="/paths/"><span class="hub-card-img"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/marco-polo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="hub-card-b"><span class="hub-card-k">65 paths</span><span class="hub-card-t">Reading Paths</span><span class="hub-card-d">Themed routes across profiles and entries, from the Silk Road to